		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Not compatible with new Baofeng DM-1801 or DM-1801A]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2401&amp;p=19916#p19916"><![CDATA[
We have know for a while that Baofeng have re-engineered the DM-1801 with completely new hardware, which is not compatible with the OpenGD77 firmware.<br><br>Today I've also been told that Baofeng also seems to have re-engineered the new version of the DM-1801A, hence this is no longer compatible with the firmware.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Sep 29, 2022 12:23 am</p><hr />
